    "searchText": "long distance covalex delivery stanton covalex_deliverypilot_stanton_foodconstructionmedical_rank1 covalex delivery standing courier pickup: stanton hi,\n\nneed a reliable contractor to pick up some packages for us and deliver them to their destination.\n\nthis route is a longer one so make sure you have enough fuel and don't forget a handheld tractor beam.\n\nand not sure what you were planning on flying, but you'll need a ship that can transport [missionmaxscusize] cargo containers\n\n[contractor]\n\nella tieno\njr. logistics coordinator\ncovalex shipping\n'anything you need, anywhere you need it.'\n\ncovalex shipping is a limited liability corporation. to encourage timely deliveries and prevent fraud on cargo hauls, covalex shipping will set a delivery time limit and upon expiration, any undelivered cargo will be considered stolen and treated as such. total payment will be prorated according to the percentage of cargo successfully delivered. 00ec51ae-578c-4cfa-b1b9-28443f2ae370 2a35b58e-d38f-4e40-a384-069b842eea90 3885ad9e-7e4b-4d72-aa57-cfb1213515a7 39fb43a6-cdf7-4fd2-81ec-dd89ded70e58 4125a0dc-3b1c-490f-ac82-fe2af36f86ff 47aec12b-f13d-4c0d-8657-c43e69048f67 48932daf-958f-4d82-bb84-2bb8fd3c6b6b 65043f32-8652-4418-adf0-15d90bfd98a3 9c9ad8ac-46b5-453f-8c7b-037db9a1d08b a035494b-a234-4f53-b109-92f641b5b06d a8c59da0-bae0-465c-8719-30680681e7b8 bd1a58b5-b953-497b-9f3d-fea8b6206466 d81cd826-7d53-46ce-882f-e18bf8dc5da2 f3549dc7-71bd-468d-80af-0c4f962bc74e standing +100 33,000 auec completion tag 86,750 auec 49,750 auec 74,500 auec 91,000 auec 66,250 auec"
